LSPosed/Vector module: spoof a fresh device identity for picked apps with zero extra taps. Selecting a target inside the app automatically writes it into the framework scope (root, takes a few seconds, no LSPosed Manager, no notification tap) -> Random/Customize in its detail -> reopen the app; a green "Injected✓" means it is active. Spoofs Android ID, Advertising ID, IMEI/MEID, IMSI/ICCID, device model, MAC, GSF ID, serial, carrier. Trilingual UI (zh/en/ru), glass UI with System/Installed filter.
